@startuml
title Book Room - Smart Campus Study Room Booking

actor Student
participant BookingService
database BookingRepository

Student -> BookingService: bookRoom(roomId, startTime, endTime)
activate BookingService

BookingService -> BookingService: validate Rules (R1: future start & duration <= 2h)

BookingService -> BookingRepository: checkRoomStatusAndOverlap(roomId, startTime, endTime)
activate BookingRepository
BookingRepository --> BookingService: room status & overlap result (R2, R3)
deactivate BookingRepository

alt Room available, unblocked, and rules valid
    BookingService -> BookingRepository: saveBooking(studentId, roomId, startTime, endTime)
    activate BookingRepository
    BookingRepository --> BookingService: booking created
    deactivate BookingRepository

    BookingService --> Student: Booking confirmed & displayed (R4 / US-07)

else Room blocked or time conflict (R2/R3 violated)
    BookingService --> Student: Booking rejected (room unavailable or rule failure)
end

deactivate BookingService

note right of BookingService
Design component:
BookingService contains validation 
and application logic for R1-R4.
- R1: Start time in future, duration <= 2h.
- R2/R3: Room must not be blocked, interval must not overlap.
- Boundary condition: end time == start time of next booking is allowed.
end note

note right of BookingRepository
Design component:
BookingRepository handles data persistence 
and queries existing bookings.
end note

note bottom
Assumptions:
1. Student is authenticated.
2. Validation completes prior to saving the booking.
3. No booking is saved on failure.
end note

@enduml